{"version":1,"content":"<p>德國汽車技術供應商ZF近日發佈了一款名為「High Revolution Drive」的新型電驅動系統。該系統最高轉速可達每分鐘30000轉，遠高於當前大多數電動汽車電機的工作轉速。憑藉這一突破性設計，新系統在維持相同性能輸出的同時，能夠顯著縮小體積、降低重量，並減少對稀土材料的依賴。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587338.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:43:49.700360+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:30:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:11.512042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:11.512042+00:00","content_hash":"be4001011fd2842524b912daf5eca9f9cb30b1acc0b8549a53c6c30420ed3089","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}